Date: Mon, 09 May 2022 17:03:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-0] rom: reposition rr apis

Range register configuration apis are repositioned to the initial
portion of the source code. This is in preparation to re-use the
apis as required.

Change-Id: I604320a918494ff3538d27fdd782360a991f3f18
---

